OL,3,GNEWSA'Criminalising culture': Buskers'
OL,4,Afury as council eyes #500 street music
OL,5,Afine
OL,6,
OL,7,FBusker David Fisher went into
OL,8,FBirmingham city centre this week to
OL,9,Fplay his guitar and sing in what was
OL,10,Fpreviously a prime busking spot - right
OL,11,Fon the high street.
OL,13,FBy doing so, he was knowingly breaching
OL,14,Fa Public Spaces Protection Order (PSPO)
OL,15,Fimplemented by Birmingham City Council
OL,16,Fa year ago, which bans people from
OL,17,Fusing musical instruments or
OL,18,Famplification equipment on certain
OL,19,Fstreets in the city centre.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
