OL,3,GNEWSA'Criminalising culture': Buskers'
OL,4,Afury as council eyes #500 street music
OL,5,Afine
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile it also affects street preachers
OL,8,Fand public speakers, it has had a
OL,9,Fmassive impact on buskers in the city.
OL,11,FFor the past year, breaching the PSPO
OL,12,Fwould land people with a #100 fine, but
OL,13,Fthe council is now considering whether
OL,14,Fto raise this to #500.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
